    "description": "esm-spec §9.6.9 (RFC out-of-line-expression-templates §8, §9.2): a `semiring`-param template referenced at TWO call sites. The admissibility of the bound semiring (the closed registry of the `faq` `semiring` field) is discharged per-instantiation on the reference-preserving form: the first call site (max_sum) is admissible, the second (bogus) is not. The offending call site is named in the diagnostic. INVALID fixture — load MUST reject. Re-pointed from the `manifold` field of the geometry leaf removed at esm 2.0.0.",
